          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Bilateral frontal headache for 3 days, described as a dull, constant tight band around the forehead and behind the eyes; severity 5/10, decreasing to 2–3/10 with paracetamol."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-2",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Headache aggravating factors"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Worse at the end of the day, with screen work and when skipping meals. Patient thinks it may relate to too much coffee on late shifts and air conditioning blowing on her face."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
      "resource": {
