          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies nausea, vomiting, visual loss, focal neurological symptoms, speech problems, confusion, fever, neck stiffness, scalp tenderness, jaw claudication, thunderclap onset, worst-ever headache, nocturnal waking, trauma, known cancer, weight loss, and pregnancy."
